  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"该接口用于解决创建计划时，设置抖音达人定向需要的相关id值，将返回抖音类目下的推荐达人，根据类目id查询抖音推荐达人。抖音类目id可以通过【查询抖音类目列表】接口获取。\",\"id\":\"ad.aweme_category_top_author.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/tools/aweme_category_top_author/get/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1697466881912835\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"ad.aweme_category_list.get\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"需要先查询抖音类目列表获取类目id，才能使用本接口查询推荐达人\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"查询抖音类目列表\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1697466881912835\",\"title\":\"查询抖音类目下的推荐达人\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-view qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-24dGiRTy\">该接口用于解决 创建计划时，设置抖音达人定向需要的相关id值</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-0bTAuPNb\">接口将返回抖音类目下的推荐达人，根据类目id查询抖音推荐达人</p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-17K2uNqZ\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-nqLJ4ulW\">抖音类目id可以通过【查询抖音类目列表】接口获取</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201772941705569357%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201748264006369288%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-bNmWUIhI\" id=\"link-0\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-6QWAHltB\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/tools/aweme_category_top_author/get/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/tools/aweme_category_top_author/get/</span></a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1697466881912835\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1777555692984388\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1839622960207943\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-reiX0PfA\" id=\"link-1\">请求方式</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-Ollw4o3B\"><strong>GET</strong>